{"id":"n61612-2-7","stage":2,"title":"살짝 · 轻轻地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61612-2-7-1","ko":"이 공은 꽤 가벼운 걸.","zh":"这个球还挺轻的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공은","meaning":"球","explanation":"공：球；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19496","senseId":"1","lemma":"공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가벼운","meaning":"轻","explanation":"가볍다：轻；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가볍다","audio":"/audio/77632f6eee12aa1b1736.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26788","senseId":"1","lemma":"가볍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"396159745e203d0d","term":"공","zh":"球","audio":"/audio/396159745e203d0de79f.mp3","entryId":"19496","definition":"用于运动或游戏的圆球形物体，大小适合手玩或脚玩。","pronunciation":["공ː"]},{"id":"130a398219d202b0","term":"꽤","zh":"颇，相当，还","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3","entryId":"38264","definition":"预期或期待以上，相当。","pronunciation":["꽤"]},{"id":"77632f6eee12aa1b","term":"가볍다","zh":"轻","audio":"/audio/77632f6eee12aa1b1736.mp3","entryId":